5 x1cy8zhl" title="‪Asslamualikum 
Road safety begins with awareness, and Traffic Awareness Session at MNS University of Agriculture, Multan successfully highlighted the importance of responsible driving and following traffic rules. The informative session was conducted under the guidance of respected speaker Rana Sarfraz Ahmad (Sector Commander M-5, Sector-I, Multan), who shared valuable insights about traffic regulations, road discipline, accident prevention, and the role of youth in creating a safer society. Students actively participated and learned how small acts of responsibility on roads can save countless lives. Together, let’s build a culture where awareness leads to safety and every journey ends securely.
Best Regards,
NAQSH Media MNSUAM.
